Z||000006||Archie||03-28-2001||06:26 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever2:<BR><B>Kinda looks like Greg Amundson's ASPP GT40 Mark I.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes Sir, We have a winner!!!!<P>This is Greg's car. This car is featured in an article in the current Kit Car Magazine. When the magazine did the article it had a little 6 banger in it. Now it has a new Chevy 330 HP 350-HO crate engine with a 6 cylinder 4 speed. <P>This one will $hit and Get.<P>Greg is the distributer for the NAF GT-40 body kit & sells them out of Louisville, KY.<P>How about a couple of more pics?<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/783s.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/784s.JPG">  <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/785s.JPG">  <P>BTW, the car has just been sold, watch out upstate NY..... it's heading your way.<P>Well, it's headed that way after I flog the V-8 swap here.<P>It's a nasty job but somebody has to do it.<P>Archie<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 03-28-2001).]||||reg||1
